    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Ugano-Game</h2><br>Ugano Game is an violent free, fantasy-penguin, 3D-open world game, we developed for 3 years.<br><br>We have two playmodes, \u201c<strong>network hangout</strong>\u201d and a \u201c<strong>singleplayer story mode</strong>\u201d to play alone. <br><br>The player can walk, crouch, jump, run, slide, paraglide and swim through this world. <br><br>Our open game world is based on a real Island at Antarctica.<br><br>In the single player mode, the player can engage in missions alongside 10+ non-player characters, accept quests, and explore a vast map spanning 20 square kilometers filled with enemies and interactive objects. In multiplayer mode, the player can team up with up to 7 other players to participate in games such as Capture the Flag, All vs All Deathmatch, and Team vs Team Snowball Fight",
    "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Ugano-Game</h2><br>Ugano Game is an violent free, fantasy-penguin, 3D-open world game, we developed for 3 years.<br><br>We have two playmodes, \u201c<strong>network hangout</strong>\u201d and a \u201c<strong>singleplayer story mode</strong>\u201d to play alone. <br><br>The player can walk, crouch, jump, run, slide, paraglide and swim through this world. <br><br>Our open game world is based on a real Island at Antarctica.<br><br>In the single player mode, the player can engage in missions alongside 10+ non-player characters, accept quests, and explore a vast map spanning 20 square kilometers filled with enemies and interactive objects. In multiplayer mode, the player can team up with up to 7 other players to participate in games such as Capture the Flag, All vs All Deathmatch, and Team vs Team Snowball Fight",
    "short_description": "A 3d open world game with singleplayer storymode and network hangout, invented by gamers for gamers.",
